# Web3Forms access key — https://web3forms.com (free, no signup for the key)
# The contact form is disabled gracefully when empty.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=""

# Cloudflare Pages project for `npm run deploy`. Optional — when empty the
# project name is derived from data.seo.siteUrl (example.com → not allowed).
CLOUDFLARE_PAGES_PROJECT=""
